      "answer": {
        "lead": "You can carry over up to 5 unused PTO days into next year. If you're on approved leave that spans December 31, the cap is 10.",
        "policy_facts": [
          {
            "text": "The standard carryover cap is 5 unused PTO days. Days above the cap are forfeited on December 31, and forfeited days are not paid out.",
