              {
                "doc_id": "RSE-PTO-01",
                "section": "5.1",
                "snippet": "You can carry over up to 5 unused PTO days into the next calendar year."
              }
            ],
            "data_sources": []
          },
          {
            "text": "If you are on approved leave under the Leave of Absence Policy that is in progress on December 31, such as parental leave, the cap is 10 days instead of 5. It is applied automatically.",
